<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">sealed-phial</ansi> (jewelcrafting recipe)

A glass vial reinforced with copper wire and fitted with a
chrysalis-infused stopper. Potions brewed in a sealed phial
age at half the normal rate, giving you more time to use them
at peak potency.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       jewelcrafting (minimum 8)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     jeweler bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> copper wire (x1), chrysalis shard (x1),
                 glass vial (x1)

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help jewelcrafting</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
